[{"code":"debug_in_release","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Aid.beni","start":{"line":6,"col":10},"end":{"line":6,"col":24}},"title":"DEBUG IN A RELEASE BUILD","message":"This `--release` build reaches `Debug`.\n\n- `Aid.beni:6:10` — `Aid.help` uses `Debug.toString`\n- `Aid.beni:6:26` — `Aid.help` uses `Debug.log`\n- `Main.beni:16:10` — `Main.step` uses `Debug.log`\n- `Main.beni:20:11` — `Main.twice` uses `Debug.log`\n- `Main.beni:20:22` — `Main.twice` uses `Debug.log`\n- … and 2 more.\n\n`Debug` is for developing: `toString` reads a value's runtime representation,\nwhich a release build is free to change; a `Debug.log` in a binding nothing\nreads is dropped along with the binding; and `todo` crashes. A release build\nmust behave exactly as the development build does, so it may not reach `Debug`\nat all. Remove the call, or build without `--release`."}]
